# Allowlist: ignore everything by default, then explicitly include only what the
# deployment image (06_Deployment/Dockerfile) needs. The rest of this repo (notebooks,
# data/, sample_data/, detector_projects/, tests/) is sizeable and irrelevant to the
# built image, so it's kept out of the build context entirely rather than copied in
# and unused.
*

!pyproject.toml

!skinbouncer_core
!skinbouncer_core/**

!labeling_tool
!labeling_tool/**

!06_Deployment
!06_Deployment/**

# Still exclude caches even under the allowed dirs above.
**/__pycache__
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
